NEW OPCODE SYSTEM:
Opcodes now 16 bits;
They have 15 types;
0 - NO ARGUMENTS
1 - TWO NUMBERS
2 - NUMBER AND MEM VAL
3 - MEM VAL AND NUMBER
4 - NUMBER, NUMBER, MEM VAL
5 - NUMBER, MEM VAL, NUMBER
6 - MEM VAL
7 - NUMBER
8 - MEM VAL, MEM VAL

